
# STASH

## Git Stash

- Sometimes I have unfinished changes but need to switch branches.

- I can temporarily save my changes using:

    git stash

- This puts my uncommitted changes aside.

- I can then switch branches.

- To get the changes back:

    git stash pop

- I can see saved stashes using:

    git stash list

- Stash is useful when I am halfway through something but suddenly need to work on something else.

